WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.995
The short strangle is similar
to the short straddle,

2
00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:19.860
though the strikes of
the options defer.

3
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.085
This is also a trade
that benefits from decay

4
00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:26.720
and decreased volatility
regardless of direction.

5
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.270
Because the strike
prices involved are

6
00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:31.325
further apart than
a short straddle,

7
00:00:31.325 --> 00:00:33.350
there is a lower risk
that this trade will

8
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.005
cause the investor
to face a loss.

9
00:00:36.005 --> 00:00:39.470
The lower associated risk
means that the investor

10
00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.970
receives a lower premium at

11
00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.430
the outset for making the trade.

12
00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.395
As were the short straddle,

13
00:00:45.395 --> 00:00:46.790
profits is kept to

14
00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.590
the initial premium while loss
is potentially unlimited.

15
00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.660
The short strangle makes
maximum profits between

16
00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.560
the two strike prices and
has two break even points.

17
00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.660
To the downside the trade

18
00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.580
makes money if the
stock stays above

19
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.320
the lower strike
price of the port

20
00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.250
minus the sum of the
two premiums paid.

21
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.380
To the upside, the trade
makes money if the stock

22
00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.350
stays below the upper
strike price for the coal,

23
00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:14.965
plus the sum of the
two premiums paid.

24
00:01:14.965 --> 00:01:17.430
Outside of these
break even points,

25
00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:20.870
the trade has unlimited loss
potential in the event that

26
00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:24.425
the share price continues
to increase or decrease,

27
00:01:24.425 --> 00:01:27.620
though the downside potential
loss is limited by the fact

28
00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.060
that the share price could only

29
00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.770
fall to a minimum of zero.